version 0.17.0
module bulk-cap

# A bulk capacitor on a 5 V rail. The class is the point of this case: `cap-tantalum-7343` is a
# generic, it names its positive pole (`positive_pin 1`), and its `voltage` requirement is compared
# in that direction — the forward stress across the two poles — instead of as a magnitude across
# the part's two pins (ADR-0078).
#
# The positive pole (pin 1, `P`) sits on the higher net and the negative pole (pin 2, `N`) on
# ground: the way round a polarised part goes. The requirement of 10 V covers the forward stress of
# 5.5 V, so the instance is compared and passes.
instances
  C1  ID7kq3mz  cap-tantalum-7343  220u  20%  10V

nets
  GND:   C1.2
  VOUT:  C1.1

ports
  GND   GND
  VOUT  VOUT
